1
00:00:01,150 --> 00:00:04,297
14 months. Not
because of my code.

2
00:00:04,327 --> 00:00:05,570
I was getting better.

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:07,006
Nine résumés.

4
00:00:07,036 --> 00:00:08,287
Nothing back.

5
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:11,320
Honestly? The gap
was in my head.

6
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:12,571
So I stopped.

7
00:00:12,601 --> 00:00:14,520
And treated it like a project.

8
00:00:14,550 --> 00:00:16,356
I looked at where
I actually fit,

9
00:00:16,386 --> 00:00:17,912
and where I didn't yet.

10
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:20,771
Every draft tailored.

11
00:00:20,801 --> 00:00:23,570
My words. Nothing
saved without me.

12
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:24,718
I practiced.

13
00:00:24,748 --> 00:00:26,000
Tracked everything.

14
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:27,720
Drafted every follow-up.

15
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:29,547
And I hit submit myself.

16
00:00:29,577 --> 00:00:31,609
This time, I knew it was ready.

17
00:00:32,150 --> 00:00:34,097
The gap's still on my résumé.

18
00:00:34,127 --> 00:00:36,529
It's just not the
headline anymore.

